Bikhra Huwa Dilbar Shabbar Ka<br>
<br>
Bikhra hua dilbar Shabbar ka Chadar mein simat kar aaya hai<br>
qayme mein hai ek mehshar barpa Qasim ka lasha aya hai... <br>
<br>
1. Massnad pa abhi tha ek dulha kubra k sar par ghoonghat tha<br>
Kis waastey shadi k ghar me sab rote hain matam hota hai...<br>
<br>
2. Dulha pyaasa dulhan pyaasi pyaase hain saare Baraati <br>
Ye kaise faza hai ranjeeda qaimo ka ye manzar kaisa hai...<br>
<br>
3. Ye bain sakina karti thi mein mehndi Lagane baithi thi<br>
Hai haat kahan aur sar hai kahan Bhaai ka ye aalam kaisa hai..<br>
<br>
4. Maqtal ko gaya Qasim pyasa aur us ka badan pamaal hua <br>
Ek bewaa ki poshak mein ab kubra ko bithaaya jata hai.. <br>
<br>
5. Lagte hai badan par zaqm agar marham bhi lagate hai un par<br>
Bikhre hue zaqmo ko aaqir kis tarha sameta jaata hai...<br>
 <br>
<br>
6. Kis darja hasee'n tha ibne Hasan ek chand zameen par tha roushan <br>
Wo chand lahu mein bikhra hai shabbir ke lab par nouha hai <br>
<br>
7. Jo Karb hai bibi Kubra ka kis se wo kahein bekas dukhiya..<br>
Hum-sin ho koi to bas us ko haal apna sunaaya jata hai...<br>
<br>
8. Nauha jo raqam karta hu Rasheed is dil mein kasak hoti hai shadeed <br>
Pamaal badan wo Qasim ka aankho ko bohot tadpata hai...<br>
